OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FTuesday will start rather
OL,6,Fcloudy with some hill fog and the odd
OL,7,Fspot of drizzle. The cloud will lift
OL,8,Fand break through during the morning
OL,9,Fto allow some warm spells of sunshine
OL,10,Fto develop for the afternoon. Breezy
OL,11,Fat first.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FMost places dry with evening
OL,14,Fsunshine followed by clear spells
OL,15,Fovernight. However, patches of low
OL,16,Fcloud and some hill fog reforming by
OL,17,Fthe morning, giving the odd spot of
OL,18,Fdrizzle.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
