OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FWednesday looks rather
OL,6,Fcloudy with the odd spot of drizzle
OL,7,Fover inland hills. Southern and
OL,8,Feastern areas seeing the best of the
OL,9,Fbrighter breaks. Showers arriving from
OL,10,Fthe northwest later.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,13,Ffresher day on Thursday with sunny
OL,14,Fspells and a few showers. Breezy on
OL,15,FFriday with isolated showers still
OL,16,Fpossible, though mostly fine on
OL,17,FSaturday with plenty of sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
